**Summary**: The `water_density_kg_m3` function at `constants.rs:245-252` correctly implements the published Kell rational polynomial. Each coefficient (a₀ through a₅ in the numerator, b₁ in the denominator) was verified against the original paper's values as reproduced by Zelentech. Signs, operator precedence, denominator inclusion, and test tolerances are all correct. Neither vendor codebase (EnergyPlus, OCHRE) uses Kell — HARES is the only one with this formulation.

